#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:5 cfb87e8b26034e52ac058fd39d9138aa
msgid "Stall Prevention"
msgstr "失速防护"

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:7 9c5534da8f0e410ab27b4aef64b40009
msgid ""
"Plane has logic to try to prevent stalls when in certain modes. This page "
"describes how it works and how to configure it."
msgstr "在某些模式下，Plane 有逻辑来尝试防止失速。本页描述其工作原理及配置方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:11 7926cb176911467bbb42ca0b08b65d06
msgid "Basic Idea"
msgstr "基本原理"

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:13 75504d34f87c430d935a387d829023a0
msgid ""
"One of the most common ways that users crash is through a stall. A stall "
"happens when the airflow over the wing is not sufficient to hold the "
"aircraft in the air. Stalls can happen at any speed, but the most common "
"type of stall is a low speed stall, where the airflow is too slow to provide"
" enough lift."
msgstr ""
"用户坠机的最常见原因之一是失速。失速发生在机翼上的气流不足以将飞行器保持在空中时。失速可以在任何速度发生，但最常见的类型是低速失速，即气流太慢无法提供足够的升力。"

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:19 5b431b5af2894075bb1717591ea93219
msgid ""
"The amount of airflow you need over the wing to hold the aircraft in the air"
" depends (among other things) on the bank angle you are flying at. If you "
"are banked over hard then you need to fly faster to get enough lift to stay "
"in the air. This is because the lift is produced perpendicular to the wing, "
"so when the wing is rolled over it provides only part of the lift to holding"
" the aircraft up, and the rest of the lift goes into making the aircraft "
"turn."
msgstr ""
"保持飞行器在空中所需的机翼气流量（除其他因素外）取决于您飞行时的倾斜角。如果倾斜角很大，则需要飞得更快以获得足够的升力保持在空中。这是因为升力垂直于机翼产生，所以当机翼倾斜时，它只提供部分升力来支撑飞行器，其余升力用于使飞行器转弯。"

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:27 085bae17851849beac786b45a4addbce
msgid ""
"When the :ref:`STALL_PREVENTION <STALL_PREVENTION>` parameter is set to 1 "
"then two things are done:"
msgstr "当 :ref:`STALL_PREVENTION <STALL_PREVENTION>` 参数设置为 1 时，将进行以下两件事："

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:30 e625780d2b224948ad57402caca8c74f
msgid ""
"when in roll controlled modes the autopilot will monitor your demanded bank "
"angle and airspeed and work out if you have sufficient margin above the "
"stall speed to turn at the demanded bank angle. If you don't then the turn "
"will be limited to the safe limit, but it will always allow a bank of at "
"least 25 degrees (to ensure you can still manoeuvre if your airspeed "
"estimate is badly off)."
msgstr ""
"在横滚控制模式下，飞控将监测您要求的倾斜角和空速，并计算是否有足够的余量高于失速速度以在要求的倾斜角下转弯。如果没有，则转弯将被限制在安全限制内，但始终允许至少"
" 25 度的倾斜（以确保在空速估算严重偏差时仍能机动）。"

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:36 a52eb50592e34a62bda9ef5d73c887a7
msgid ""
"when in auto-throttle modes the autopilot will also raise the minimum "
"airspeed in the :ref:`TECS system <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-"
"speed-height-tuning-guide>` to the level at which the current demanded bank "
"angle can be safely achieved. So it will add more engine power or lower the "
"nose to raise the airspeed so that the bank angle that the navigation "
"controller is demanding can be achieved without a stall"
msgstr ""
"在自动油门模式下，飞控还将提高 :ref:`TECS 系统 <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-"
"height-tuning-guide>` "
"中的最低空速至可以安全实现当前要求倾斜角的水平。因此它将增加发动机功率或降低机头以提高空速，使导航控制器要求的倾斜角能够实现而不会失速"

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:44 17a95b6d36ce4176b14f53b7e730ae77
msgid "Configuring stall prevention"
msgstr "配置失速防护"

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:46 73916c41aafc4d759086e29e827d478b
msgid "There are two key parameters that control stall prevention:"
msgstr "有两个关键参数控制失速防护："

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:48 3bc95284503e47af8b9e380cda4a7ddd
msgid ""
"The :ref:`STALL_PREVENTION <STALL_PREVENTION>` parameter. If this is set to "
"zero then no stall prevention is done. This may be useful if you have no "
"airspeed sensor and the synthetic airspeed estimate is not good enough"
msgstr ""
":ref:`STALL_PREVENTION <STALL_PREVENTION>` "
"参数。如果设置为零，则不执行失速防护。如果没有空速传感器且合成空速估算不够好，这可能很有用"

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:52 f54b03e6c4a646f99000986a2e6ff1de
msgid ""
"The :ref:`AIRSPEED_STALL<AIRSPEED_STALL>` parameter. If stall prevention is "
"enabled this speed is used to calculate the minimum airspeed while banking. "
"If this is set to 0 then the stall speed is assumed to be the "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>`. Typically it is set slightly higher then "
"true stall speed. It is this value that is scaled with the bank angle to "
"calculate the safe airspeed for any demanded bank angle."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AIRSPEED_STALL<AIRSPEED_STALL>` 参数。如果启用了失速防护，该速度用于在倾斜时计算最低空速。如果设置为 "
"0，则假设失速速度为 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>`。通常设置为略高于真实失速速度。该值与倾斜角缩放，以计算任何要求倾斜角的安全空速。"

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:55 37a027ffae184275bb78981ff439ef56
msgid "Affected modes"
msgstr "受影响的模式"

