#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:71 86f0c2c3fee54be5abfc54921e66ac38
msgid ""
"In each of these modes the aircraft is either calculating a desired bank "
"angle for the navigation code, or the user is inputting a desired bank angle"
" via the aileron stick. In both cases the stall prevention code will limit "
"the bank angle based on the amount of margin between ``AIRSPEED_MIN`` and "
"the current airspeed."
msgstr ""
"在这些模式中，飞行器要么由导航代码计算所需倾斜角，要么用户通过副翼摇杆输入所需倾斜角。在两种情况下，失速防护代码都将根据 "
"``AIRSPEED_MIN`` 与当前空速之间的余量来限制倾斜角。"

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:77 5e71aa1b6f8c4885bbfb5332b90830e4
