"The following modes are affected by the automatic speed increase in TECS "
"when the bank angle is limited by stall prevention:"
msgstr "以下模式受当倾斜角被失速防护限制时 TECS 自动速度增加的影响："

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:87 a2982309ef1c443da013a71d877bddb0
msgid ""
"These are all of the \"auto throttle\" modes, where the TECS controller "
"controls pitch and throttle."
msgstr "这些都是「自动油门」模式，其中 TECS 控制器控制俯仰和油门。"

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:91 a81954da6de74c2c91440516e6ab4212
msgid "Example Usage"
msgstr "使用示例"

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:93 115d8a9e8e4149578d886125693c49d6
msgid ""
"An example of how stall prevention works is in AUTO mode when making a turn "
"for an automated landing. The landing approach will aim for an airspeed of "
":ref:`TECS_LAND_ARSPD <TECS_LAND_ARSPD>`, which is often quite low, and may "
"be just above the stall speed. If the final turn is sharp (it is often 90 "
"degrees) the plane may be trying to perform a sharp turn while dropping "
"speed for landing. That could induce a stall. The stall prevention code "
"means two things happen:"
msgstr ""
"失速防护工作方式的一个示例是在 Auto 模式下进行自动降落转弯时。降落进近将以 :ref:`TECS_LAND_ARSPD "
"<TECS_LAND_ARSPD>` 的空速为目标，通常相当低，可能刚好高于失速速度。如果最终转弯很急（通常为 90 "
"度），飞机可能在降落减速时尝试进行急转弯。这可能导致失速。失速防护代码意味着两件事会发生："

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:101 435dd412ded04a0f839628f1a16e9e91
msgid "the initial turn is kept shallow enough to prevent the stall"
msgstr "初始转弯保持足够浅以防止失速"

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:102 1e15038ed8b043bcab6518a2a1421069
msgid ""
"the target airspeed is kept high enough during the turn to allow the turn to"
" complete, after which it is lowered"
msgstr "转弯期间目标空速保持足够高以允许转弯完成，之后再降低"

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:106 c4cac21e0ccf417db626847eea2ed539
msgid "Nose Down in FBWA and AUTOTUNE"
msgstr "FBWA 和 AUTOTUNE 中的机头下压"

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:108 638bfa48b05e4316b035399f1988825a
msgid ""
"The FBWA mode has an additional special feature to help prevent straight "
"line stalls. It is often difficult for a pilot to judge the airspeed of a "
"plane when it is coming head on, and so many pilots find themselves flying "
"too slow when they are trying to fly gently in FBWA mode. This is especially"
" true if the ArduPilot pitch controller is well tuned and manages to keep "
"the nose up even when flying slowly."
msgstr ""
"FBWA 模式有一个额外的特殊功能，有助于防止直线失速。飞手通常很难判断迎头飞来的飞机的空速，因此许多飞手在 FBWA 模式下轻柔飞行时会飞得太慢。如果"
" ArduPilot 俯仰控制器调参良好，能够在低速飞行时保持机头上仰，这尤为如此。"

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:115 85eef79416a04defae894e144fe331f0
msgid ""
"To make a level flight low speed stall less likely some additional down "
"pitch is added in FBWA and AUTOTUNE modes based on the throttle position. "
"The amount of down pitch added is based on the :ref:`STAB_PITCH_DOWN "
"<STAB_PITCH_DOWN>` parameter, which defaults to 2 degrees. At zero throttle "
"this full down pitch is added. If throttle is above ``TRIM_THROTTLE`` then "
"no down pitch is added. Between those two values the down pitch is added in "
"proportion to the throttle."
msgstr ""
"为了降低水平低速失速的可能性，在 FBWA 和 AUTOTUNE 模式下，根据油门位置会增加一些额外的下压俯仰。增加的下压俯仰量基于 "
":ref:`STAB_PITCH_DOWN <STAB_PITCH_DOWN>` 参数，默认为 2 度。在零油门时，全部下压俯仰被添加。如果油门高于 "
"``TRIM_THROTTLE``，则不添加下压俯仰。在这两个值之间，下压俯仰按比例与油门成反比添加。"

#: ../../source/docs/stall-prevention.rst:124 9cab142282004ec3b76edeb8f8264b6f
msgid ""
"This has the effect of slightly lowering the nose when you lower throttle in"
" FBWA and AUTOTUNE modes, which makes the plane gain a bit of speed, and "
"thus makes it less likely to stall. The value you need for "
"``STAB_PITCH_DOWN`` depends on how much drag your plane has. A very sleek "
"model will need a smaller value. A high drag model will need a larger value."
msgstr ""
"这在 FBWA 和 AUTOTUNE 模式下降低油门时会稍微降低机头，使飞机获得一点速度，从而降低失速的可能性。``STAB_PITCH_DOWN`` "
"所需的值取决于飞机的阻力大小。非常流线型的模型需要较小的值。高阻力模型需要较大的值。"
